4642..4718 Comment "/// book\'s Theorem 8.1.9, one stratum down). The later entries read `to` and"
4719..4794 Comment "/// `back`, so the record is their dependent pairs nested to the right, and"
4795..4871 Comment "/// its value nests the same way: `sectWords` and `retrWords` are checked at"
